%% 07 Sequence: a port scan from one host to an incident and a notification
sequenceDiagram
  participant S as ravend
  participant P as pipeline
  participant W as windows/features
  participant D as portscan detector
  participant C as correlation
  participant Z as sanitizer
  participant E as explain (LLM or template)
  participant N as notifier
  S->>P: flow events (SYN, RST bursts from 192.168.2.3)
  P->>W: update 10s, 5m, 1h windows
  W->>D: window features (unique_ports, failed_ratio)
  D->>P: Alert(T1046, severity, confidence, numeric evidence)
  P->>C: alert
  C->>P: Incident(chain=[T1046], score)
  P->>Z: structured incident fields
  Z->>E: sanitized fields only
  E->>P: summary (faithfulness-checked, else template)
  P->>N: sanitized summary + GUI link (if budget and mode allow)
  N-->>P: delivery result (failure never blocks detection)
